{
  "about": "INTEGRATE1f part f1 (the integration design §5.5, §5.9; D215's notes on INTEGRATE1a and INTEGRATE1j): the environment a gate is composed with, and the digest of a gate's composition, one table for both readers: tools/merge-branch.mjs (gateEnvironment, compositionDigest; src/Daoris.Cli/tool-test/integration-gates.test.ts) and the driver's GateEnvironment and GateComposition (GateEnvironmentTests). A path is neutral, X:/. The tool also removes the tool tests' two stand-in variables (QUEUE_DRAIN_DIR, QUEUE_DROP_HOLD), which a gate of the driver's never meets: no row names them.",
  "beside": { "MSBUILDDISABLENODEREUSE": "1", "DOTNET_CLI_USE_MSBUILD_SERVER": "0", "UseSharedCompilation": "false" },
  "removed": [
    "/^DAORIS_/i",
