  "driverOnly": {
    "about": "What the driver's gate is given that the tool's is not, yet: the admission's hold marker (the tool's gates get no Daoris name until its hold plumbing, D215's note on INTEGRATE1b part 2), and a build-server name folded by case, which a process environment on Windows holds once.",
    "holds": [
      {
        "name": "the hold marker is the one Daoris name a gate gets on purpose, after everything else",
